<<directionless_trailing, Directionless parameters in ``direction^{asterisk}^`` only appear at the end>>


. Return ``<<directionless_trailing',`` ``directionless_trailing'(true,`` ``rev_<direction>(direction^{asterisk}^))>>``.

<<directionless_trailing', directionless_trailing'(bool, direction^{asterisk}^)>>


. If ``direction^{asterisk}^`` is an empty list: return ``true``.
. Else:
 .. Let ``direction~h~`` ``{two-colons}`` ``direction~t~^{asterisk}^`` be ``direction^{asterisk}^``.
 .. Check that ``direction~h~`` does not match pattern ```EMPTY``.
 .. Return ``<<directionless_trailing',`` ``directionless_trailing'(false,`` ``direction~t~^{asterisk}^)>>``.
. If ``bool`` is equal to ``true``:
 .. Check that ``direction^{asterisk}^`` is a non-empty list.
 .. Let ``direction'`` ``{two-colons}`` ``direction~t~^{asterisk}^`` be ``direction^{asterisk}^``.
 .. Check that ``direction'`` is ```EMPTY``.
 .. Return ``<<directionless_trailing',`` ``directionless_trailing'(true,`` ``direction~t~^{asterisk}^)>>``.
. Else:
 .. Check that ``direction^{asterisk}^`` is a non-empty list.
 .. Let ``direction'`` ``{two-colons}`` ``direction~t~^{asterisk}^`` be ``direction^{asterisk}^``.
 .. Check that ``direction'`` is ```EMPTY``.
 .. Return ``false``.

