<<ExternFunctionCall_eval_lctk, ExternFunctionCall_eval_lctk>>:

* Calling an extern function ``nameIR``(``nameIR^{asterisk}^``) under typing context ``typingContext``:
* Results in ``value``.

<<Expr_eval_lctk, Expr_eval_lctk>>:

* Local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR``, under cursor ``cursor`` and typing context ``typingContext``:
* Results in ``value``.

<<Expr_eval_lctk, Local compile-time evaluation of ``booleanLiteral`` annotated with ``expressionNoteIR``, under cursor ``p`` and typing context ``TC``>>:

. If ``booleanLiteral`` is ``TRUE``:
 .. Result in ```B`` ``true``.
. Else:
 .. Result in ```B`` ``false``.

<<Expr_eval_lctk, Local compile-time evaluation of ``integerLiteral`` annotated with ``expressionNoteIR``, under cursor ``p`` and typing context ``TC``>>:

. If let ``D`` ``i`` be ``integerLiteral``:
 .. Result in ``D`` ``i``.
. Else if let ``n`` ``W`` ``i`` be ``integerLiteral``:
 .. Result in ``n`` ``W`` ``i``.
. Else:
 .. Let ``n`` ``S`` ``i`` be ``integerLiteral``.
 .. Result in ``n`` ``S`` ``i``.

<<Expr_eval_lctk, Local compile-time evaluation of ``"`` ``text`` ``"`` annotated with ``expressionNoteIR``, under cursor ``p`` and typing context ``TC``>>:

. Result in ``"`` ``text`` ``"``.

<<Expr_eval_lctk, Local compile-time evaluation of ``prefixedNameIR`` annotated with ``expressionNoteIR``, under cursor ``p`` and typing context ``TC``>>:

. Let ``value`` be <<find_var_value_t, the value of variable ``prefixedNameIR`` in the ``p`` layer of ``TC``>>.
. Result in ``value``.

<<Expr_eval_lctk, Local compile-time evaluation of ``...`` annotated with ``expressionNoteIR``, under cursor ``p`` and typing context ``TC``>>:

. Result in ``DEFAULT``.

<<Expr_eval_lctk, Local compile-time evaluation of ``unop`` ``typedExpressionIR`` annotated with ``expressionNoteIR``, under cursor ``p`` and typing context ``TC``>>:

. Let ``value`` be
* the result of <<Expr_eval_lctk, local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR``, under cursor ``p`` and typing context ``TC``>>.
. Result in <<un_op, ``unop`` ``value``>>.

<<Expr_eval_lctk, Local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~l~`` ``binop`` ``typedExpressionIR~r~`` annotated with ``expressionNoteIR``, under cursor ``p`` and typing context ``TC``>>:

. If ``binop`` is not in ``[&&,`` ``||]``:
 .. Let ``value~l~`` be
* the result of <<Expr_eval_lctk, local compile-time evaluation of ``typedExpressionIR~l~``, under cursor ``p`` and typing context ``TC``>>.
